sequenceDiagram
  %% status: draft
  %% command: schedule:logs
  %% kind: schedule.logs
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as Node
  alt CLI --follow
    Note over CLI: Refuse Schedule follow<br/>schedule.follow_unavailable
  else bounded snapshot
    CLI->>GW: schedule:logs <schedule>
    alt migrated Instance Schedule
      Note over GW: Stopped container refuses<br/>schedule.target_inactive · no wake
      GW->>SW: Read container journal<br/>shared runtime inspection
      SW->>N: Read Schedule logs<br/>Ansible · schedule-logs
      N-->>SW: Bounded journal read
      %%> Limits:
      %%> - complete entries within 4 MiB of UTF-8 bytes and the 8 MiB JSON transport limit, with 16 KiB reserved for the envelope
      SW-->>GW: Private vault reference
      Note over GW: Read private output<br/>Redact stored values
    else other Schedule
      Note over GW: Read pinned Agent journal<br/>Redact stored values
    end
    GW-->>CLI: Snapshot and request ID
  end
